    // setup or the credit moves and nobody would notice, because it reads as
    // prose rather than as a figure.
    costMath: `${euro(AMOUNT.brandModelCredit, 'en')} comes off each of your first ${BRAND_MODEL_CREDIT_DROPS} drops, so once you have run ${BRAND_MODEL_CREDIT_DROPS} drops the setup has returned in full and the face is still yours. Before that point you are paying for exclusivity, which is the honest way to describe it.`,
