      'This is where visuals stop being photographs and start being brand equity. A consistent face is what turns a scroll-past into recognition: people know your images before they read your name. It works everywhere your brand appears, because being everywhere and being consistent is the whole point.',
    ],
    fitWhereH: 'Where it lives',
    fitWhere: [
