     the alternative you already have, and saying so plainly is what makes
     the Brand Model an honest upsell rather than a gate. Four of the ten,
     not all ten: the full roster now has its own page at /models, and
     showing all ten here again would put the same ten portraits on two
     pages for search engines to index as duplicate content. -->
